       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the maximum labeled ibuprofen dose.\n\n- **Single dose:** The usual maximum is 800 mg per dose. This order is 1600 mg.\n- **Daily total:** The maximum is 3,200 mg/day for adults, and this order is 6,400 mg/day. That raises the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), which is the maximum for inflammatory or rheumatologic indications.\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day).\n- **400 mg PO every 6 hours** (1,600 mg/day), which is common for pain or fever.\n- **1600 mg/day total**, if that was the intended daily amount. It could be given as 400 mg four times daily or 800 mg twice daily.\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me and include a brief clinical rationale for the order note. I'll enter it as you specify."
      }
